{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk 是一款將路線規劃、GPS 跑步與步行記錄、5K/10K 訓練、力量及伸展集中在一起的運動 App，適合想建立穩定運動習慣的用戶。現時終生版內購<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $29.99，毋須訂閱即可長久使用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-56.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>路線規劃與運動記錄</h2>\n<p>Three Routes 把路線規劃、GPS 運動記錄、5K 或 10K 訓練、力量與伸展整合於一身。用戶可透過 Apple Maps 行人指示尋找最多三條路線，規劃環形或原路折返，亦可按距離、時間與步速設定；訓練計劃可一鍵配合路線，記錄戶外步行與跑步，支援 Apple Watch 語音提示及觸覺回饋，並可保存路線、分享 GPX，以及用手機鏡頭計深蹲。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-302-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-303-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-304-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-305-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-306-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-307-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/three-routes-run-walk/id6823810305\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:28.224013+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":499,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:26:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T21:38:06.186297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:49.137160+00:00","content_hash":"5f4f703dc2050853adff43a016e107af9e8831ff211e376c6a7588e6be797453","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}